      "context": "Let’s talk about my Tet Holidays! I have been to Hanoi to go to university for 3 years, so I often come back to my hometown on Tet Holidays. On these occasions, I visit my parents and my relatives many times. However, during the last Tet holiday, I (1)____ when I decided not to go home. \nMy friends and I went for a trip to a rural area in the North of Vietnam. This area is great to (2)____ that you cannot find anywhere. On the day we traveled, in the early morning, we woke up early to get ready. When we arrived I was surprised because this place was changing. (3)____ anymore, with a lot of modern buildings and vehicles. (4)____ selling a lot of items. I was shocked but I still took some photos to keep memories. On the second day, it rained all day and I had to spend the trip at the hotel watching the rain. (5)____",
